00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.060
Nona Lin,

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:14.610
Apa pendapat Anda tentang legenda Anggur Perpisahan ini?

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.060
Sungguh mengharukan.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.770
Saya tidak menyangka sang Jenderal ternyata seorang pendongeng.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:32.730
Nona Lin,

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.370
